{
 "_doc": [
  "Window 6 (2026-09-24, quiet from 08:10 MSK, timed passes end by 12:45). One list, blocks in PRIORITY order; each block = 2 passes x 3 rounds (K = 6 per cell), pass 0 W ascending with arms alternating inside a W group, pass 1 the whole list reversed, one untimed warm-up process per pass.",
  "P1 L10 pre-C0 refutation (08-DESIGN-REV2.3.md:221; E8 recipe l10/plan.md:454). P2 L9 C0 refutation -> C4 (02-DESIGN-REV1.md:380 and the G-TW L9b arms :408-410). P3 tree broadphase C3b query cost (c3b/design.md:215-226, two binaries: no --bp-kernel flag). P4 L11 G9 remainder (window 5 analysis.md:227; L11 02-DESIGN-REV1.md:359-371; row spellings = window 4b rows.json). P5 extras (only if the budget allows). P5 order: bridge 2, L10 spans (J-Son W8, R-S W1/8), C3b G5 same-binary tree vs allpairs on the tip, L9 J-D, L9 R, L9 J-A W 2/4/16, C3b G4 criterion (longest, last).",
  "Every runner process: <row args> --workers W --steps S --window a..b --csv <cwd>/run.csv --pose-out <cwd>/pose.bin --label <id>#<role>@W<W> [--arm-profiler] --expect-pose gate/fixtures/<pose_ref>.pose; exit 4 on a pose mismatch.",
  "Statistic per process: the mean of wall_ns over the row's window (zone columns: per-process mean and median over the window, the row's metric_windows and the all-frozen tail); per cell: MEDIAN over K; spreads relative to the median, as in windows 3-5: r = (max - min), i = IQR, s = SE of the median = 1.2533 * sd / sqrt(K); B against A is CLAIMED iff |B/A - 1| > 2*sqrt(sA^2 + sB^2) under BOTH r and s (i printed)."
 ],
